/-! # Normalized directed base profiles, with exact parallel-bond multiplicities

A profile specifies how many bonds of each unordered bundle are directed
from the smaller endpoint to the larger. Parallel occurrences of the same
direction are interchangeable. Exhaustiveness is proved separately from
the source degree equations; these lists alone are not that proof.
-/

public section
namespace WaveTurbulence.Vine.Param

/-- Number of normalized balanced orientation profiles of each pinned base. -/
@[expose] def baseProfileCount : VineType → ℕ
  | .I => 1
  | .II => 4
  | .III => 24
  | .IV => 16
  | .V => 16
  | .VI => 128
  | .VII => 48
  | .VIII => 32

/-- Unordered base bundles and their multiplicities, in first-occurrence order. -/
